submittedParameters.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: production isometric world industry sprites.
Exactly NINE separate complete building compounds, strict 3 by 3 evenly spaced grid. Genuine transparent alpha, square target2048. IMPORTANT leave WIDE CLEAR transparent gutters: each complete compound entirely inside its one cell, ONLY 80% of cell width and 80% of cell height, all nine same maximum footprint scale. Nothing crossing grid boundaries. No huge blank space at top.
2:1 orthographic isometric camera viewed from southeast; daylight upper-left. Thin grey stone or soil rhombus bases, no tall floating-island sides. Finest crisp Taoist chibi handpainting: jade/teal roofs, warm ivory plaster, restrained warm gold/copper, rounded detailed shapes, natural materials. Match attached mail/team images for material and brush finish, third world image for actual world-building camera/scale. These are game world assets not UI badges.
Left to right/top to bottom:
1 temperate mixed farm: small teal-roof farmhouse, timber barn, pale grain silo and enclosed cattle pen;
2 copper mine: terraced rust-orange ore face, timber mine hoist and teal service shed, visible orange copper ore heap;
3 onshore oil well: one large dark green/gold horsehead oil pumpjack on sturdy base, small ivory tank and teal service hut, no pipes extending beyond cell;
4 temperate city bank: dignified compact two-storey ivory bank with jade hipped roof, gold-trim barred vault door and coin medallion ornament, no letters;
5 food processing plant: cream processing hall, grain hoppers, milk churns and food crates, teal roof, distinct enclosed loading awning;
6 paper mill: large pale paper rolls, waterwheel and covered timber pulp vat beside jade-roof workshop;
7 gold mine: ochre-grey rocky face, timber pithead and gold ore carts with tiny gold nuggets, jade-roof shed, distinctly different mine silhouette;
8 tropical/arctic bank: shorter broad stone treasury, teal dome/hipped roof, round bronze vault door, two tiny palms in pots only (no snow), clearly different architecture from bank4;
9 diamond mine: open terraced pale-grey pit, ivory/teal sorter tower, gravel conveyor and a tiny raw pale-cyan crystal cluster, no oversized fantasy crystals.
No people, text, UI frames, numbers, logos, watermark, smoke clouds, photorealism, pixel art, glossy plastic. Every building fully intact and with its own clear silhouette.

